     2448       bfpc_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-base-doc    = bf_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-base-doc    - bf_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-base-acc
     2449       bfpc_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-rubl-doc    = bf_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-rubl-doc    - bf_tt-allsum.sum-dsc-rubl-acc
